+The fresh producer process reuses unchanged input/app bytes and the preserved actual mock19076 execution/reset/audit packet. No duplicate Identity qualification execution is needed for this validation-only correction. Both earlier app/mock generations, their source labels and state remain preserved; neither is claimed to load this correction. Independent12 review must precede58 state-writing acceptance.
